@* ===== Home: the intro band =====
     Promise, proof, and one clear next step, centred so the band reads the
     same at every width. The four practical answers follow in _StartHere. *@
<section class="home-hero" id="home">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="home-hero__inner">
            <span class="eyebrow">A slow travel guide</span>
            <h1>Discover Armenia</h1>
            <p class="home-hero__lead">
                The land of ancient monasteries, mountain roads and apricots — with a
                6,000-year-old wine tradition. Take it slowly; you will see more.
            </p>

            <div class="home-hero__actions">
                <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#destinations">Explore destinations</a>
                <a class="btn btn--outline" href="#plan">Plan your trip</a>
